        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "useRawFormat": true,
          "markdown": "**RootHide / Dopamine-roothide** 选 `arm64e`；**rootless / Dopamine** 选 `arm64`。两个架构**不可同时安装**。\n\n装完执行 `killall -9 SpringBoard` 或注销桌面生效。"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView"
        },
        {
